# Normalise line endings. Several Go files in this repo were checked out with
# CRLF because core.autocrlf=true rewrites them on checkout, which makes gofmt
# report the whole file as misformatted and buries real edits in a whitespace
# diff. Pin the working tree to LF so gofmt means the same thing everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets that must not be touched.
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
